- `constructor-unit-tests`: 

**How to implement.** Nothing under `Berreman/OpticalConstructor/` names `.ocproj` any more (001 §T 'From section 4: `git grep -n -i -F "ocproj" -- Berreman/OpticalConstructor/` finds nothing'; the S4.4 brief). Comments, schema descriptions and test literals only; no behaviour changes. (1) The groups file: `OpticalConstructor.Storage/GroupsLibrary.fs`'s module doc (`GroupsLibrary.fs:13-25`) becomes one to three lines: the per-user groups and experiment-collections file, read and written through the shared options and validated on load through `validateWith`, a `schemaVersion` mismatch being `SchemaValidationErr`. `OpticalConstructor.Domain/Groups.fs`' `GroupsLibrary` doc (`Groups.fs:180-182`) loses its clause 'it is kept apart from any per-project `.ocproj`'. `schema/optical-constructor-groups.schema.json`'s `description` (`:5`) loses 'kept apart from any per-project .ocproj,'; nothing else in the schema changes. `OpticalConstructor.Tests/GroupsRoundTripTests.fs`' doc (`GroupsRoundTripTests.fs:20`) loses 'independent of any `.ocproj`;'. (2) The environment file's two old-file facts, `an old environment.json carrying a recentFiles array still loads, field ignored, no migration` and `load reads an old on-disk environment.json with a recentFiles array without falling back to defaults` (`EnvironmentRoundTripTests.fs:383`, `:395`), graft `[ "C:/kits/a", "C:/kits/b" ]` and `[ "C:/kits/a" ]` for their `.ocproj` names; their assertions are unchanged. (3) `OpticalConstructor.Domain/Scene.fs`, `OpticalConstructor.Domain/ExperimentCollectionStore.fs` and `OpticalConstructor.Domain.fsproj` are in scope because steps 151 and 152 rewrote their `.ocproj` wording (`OpticalConstructor.Domain.fsproj:141-155` today): a comment line of them that still names `.ocproj` loses those words and keeps what stays true, gaining none (AGENTS.md). (4) `.gitignore`: the `*.binz` comment (`.gitignore:336-338`) drops its last sentence, 'Canonical `.ocproj` project files remain committable.', because the sidecars stay (`Sidecar.fs:Sidecar`) and no project file exists; the rule is unchanged. Afterwards `git grep -n -i -F "ocproj" -- Berreman/OpticalConstructor/` finds nothing, which S5.1 onward asserts as an invariant.

**Acceptance.** After the last `.ocproj` wording goes, `git grep -n -i -F "ocproj" -- Berreman/OpticalConstructor/` MUST find nothing and `.gitignore` MUST still ignore `*.binz`; constructor-unit-tests MUST pass, including `an old environment.json carrying a recentFiles array still loads, field ignored, no migration` and `load reads an old on-disk environment.json with a recentFiles array without falling back to defaults` over their new literals and every GroupsRoundTripTests fact, the count unchanged; and build, elevation and the twelve s18 invariants MUST pass.
